and (v) the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements, tagged as blocks of text and including detailed tags.</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">104</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">The cover page from the Company&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2025, formatted in iXBRL (included as Exhibit 101).</span></div></td></tr></table></div><div style="margin-top:1pt;padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-27pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">*&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Management contract or compensatory plan or agreement.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-27pt"><span><br/></span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-27pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">(a)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Certain information has been omitted in accordance with Item 601(b)(10) of Regulation S-K because it is both not material and is the type of information that the Registrant treats as private or confidential. An unredacted copy will be furnished supplementally to the SEC upon request.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(1)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:6.34pt">Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Annual Report on Form  10-K filed for the year ended December 31, 2018 filed on February 27, 2019.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">(2)   Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2004 filed on March 16, 2005.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">(3)   Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit to the Registrant&#8217;s definitive Proxy Statement with respect to its 2007 Annual Meeting of Shareholders as filed on March 30, 2007.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(4)   Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the period ended June 30, 2022 filed on August 4, 2022.</span></div><div style="height:42.75pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="-sec-extract:summary;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">100</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:42.75pt;width:100%"><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">(5)   Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Form 8&#8209;K filed on March 26, 2015.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(6) Incorporated by reference to the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Quarterly Report on Form10&#8209;Q for the period ended June 30, 2020 filed on August 4, 2020.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span><br/></span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(7) Incorporated by reference to the similarly described exhibit to the Registrant&#8217;s Form 8-K filed on February 25, 2019.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(8) Incorporated by reference to the similarly described exhibit to the Registrant&#8217;s Form 8-K filed on May 28, 2024.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(9) Incorporated by reference to the similarly described exhibit to the Registrant&#8217;s Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the period ended June 30, 2021 filed on August 5, 2021.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(10) Incorporated by reference to the similarly described exhibit to the Registrant&#8217;s Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the period ended March 31, 2021 filed on May 4, 2021.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(11) Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10&#8209;K for the year ended December 31, 2020 filed on February 19, 2021.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(12) Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Form 8-K filed on May 24, 2017.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(13) Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10&#8209;K for the year ended December 31, 2021 filed on February 25, 2022.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(14) Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10&#8209;K for the year ended December 31, 2022 filed on February 28, 2023.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(15) Incorporated by reference from the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10&#8209;K for the year ended December 31, 2023 filed on February 27, 2024.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(16) Incorporated by reference to the similarly described exhibit included with the Registrant&#8217;s Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the period ended March 31, 2024 filed on May 2, 2024.</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-18p