$</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-18" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:LoansHeldForSaleFairValueDisclosure" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-929">1,290.2</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr></table></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(1)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:7.52pt">Pursuant to Ginnie Mae servicing guidelines.</span></div><div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(2)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:7.52pt">Includes reverse mortgage loans purchased from Ginnie Mae securitization pools that reached the 98% of maximum claim amount and are generally liquidated through foreclosure and subsequent sale of the REO properties. As of December&#160;31, 2025 and December&#160;31, 2024, the balance includes $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-88" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:MortgagesHeldForSaleFairValueDisclosure" scale="6" id="f-930">698.2</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-89" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:MortgagesHeldForSaleFairValueDisclosure" scale="6" id="f-931">375.4</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively